# 555 blinky. THE source of truth — commit this, build the rest.
# python ocd.py examples/blinky_555.ocd
board blinky555 40x30 2L
part U1 SOIC8 NE555
part R1 R0805 1k
part R2 R0805 10k
part R3 R0805 330
part C1 C0805 10u
part C2 C0805 100n
part D1 LED0805 red
part J1 PINHD2 9V
net VCC: J1.1 U1.8 U1.4 R1.1
net GND: J1.2 U1.1 C1.1 C2.2 D1.2
net N_DIS: U1.7 R1.2 R2.1
net N_TH: U1.6 U1.2 R2.2 C1.2
net N_OUT: U1.3 R3.1
net N_LED: R3.2 D1.1
net N_CV: U1.5 C2.1
fix J1 at 3 15
keep U1 near C1 3
keep U1 near C2 3
route GND on 1
power VCC GND
